WEBVTT

00:11.720 --> 00:13.180
Thanks for cooking.

00:13.730 --> 00:16.030
You can leave the dishes right there.

00:16.430 --> 00:18.790
Breakfast was great.

00:20.470 --> 00:22.600
Th-Thanks...

00:29.160 --> 00:30.680
What's up, Ami?

00:30.680 --> 00:34.730
Hayacchi squeezed my boobs 
so much that they hurt now.

00:34.730 --> 00:35.390
Huh?

00:35.390 --> 00:36.890
Let's talk about what <i>you</i> did!

00:36.890 --> 00:39.900
First you broke my brand-new laptop 
by swinging a dumbbell around,

00:39.900 --> 00:42.770
and then you <i>told</i> me to squeeze your boobs!

00:42.770 --> 00:44.380
But still...

00:44.380 --> 00:47.730
You know you shouldn't swing 
dumbbells around indoors.

00:48.110 --> 00:50.280
If you hit someone, they could get hurt.

00:50.280 --> 00:51.580
Right.

00:51.580 --> 00:52.570
And Hayato...

00:52.880 --> 00:55.210
If you have to squeeze her boobs, do it gently.

00:55.210 --> 00:57.240
Ami's still a girl, you know.

00:57.240 --> 00:58.410
What?!

00:58.410 --> 01:02.330
Yeah, that's right! Squeeze 'em gently!

01:03.750 --> 01:05.140
Or maybe not.

01:24.060 --> 01:26.640
<b></b>The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses

